Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","review_id":"Vh53nsHdhESBkjtTVu06MA","date":"2018-12-03T23:03:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9457597732543945,"text_excerpt":"This place was fun! My uncles from Philly were in town and of course they randomly wanted a cheesesteak. Immediately I knew where to take them. Full disclosure I hadn't been before just heard from reputable people that they were a good representation of really Philly steaks. As fate would have it (assuming he isn't there all day every day) the owner was in the building. You know they had to give him a hard time about whether or not he was really from Philly. Being that it was the week after the Saints game against the Eagles here in New Orleans he also had to give them a hard time for missing the game and for wanting a cheesesteak while they were here. It was a good time. We ate and drank..."},{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","review_id":"XaTHzX8dmAru6ptDwgrqvQ","date":"2018-07-30T14:56:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451262950897217,"text_excerpt":"I'm not going to pretend to be an expert on Philly Cheesesteaks. So I ask you forgive me citizens of Philadelphia if this place isn't as legit or great as I may perceive it to be. Lord knows us New Orleanians are extra critical of places that serve jambalaya or gumbo when we are out of the state. But either way, the cheesesteak I had here (The Wiz) was excellent. This is New Orleans, not Philadelphia, so I think given that obvious fact, this is the best Philly cheesesteak you can have here in The Big Easy! It was great and I will be back. I came on a Friday afternoon and the service was splendid as well. No complaints over here."},{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","review_id":"CnXZrZKKDQMnS6WJZLs-uQ","date":"2013-06-27T01:57:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9447961449623108,"text_excerpt":"Solid Place, coming from someone who lived in Philly for four years. Oh and it takes credit card. Huzzah. To be honest, cheesesteak isn't my favorite food, it probably doesn't even crack my top 10, but, this place does them right. First of all, cheesesteak isn't supposed to be fancy, nor does it actually use steak quality meat. It is meant to be the working, blue collared man (or woman)'s food. The stuff that you dig into when you're hungry and when you want to sink into the blissful oblivion of food induced coma. It's warm and juicy and reminds you of home. Anyways, I digress. When you come here, first order cheesesteak the way it is meant to be eaten - with fried onions and cheese whiz...."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","photo_id":"_S2WNOZCvr8z7uYU5Fp_dQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_S2WNOZCvr8z7uYU5Fp_dQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8886692523956299},{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","photo_id":"sRm_TXP3v5XQd-pcL0Ascw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sRm_TXP3v5XQd-pcL0Ascw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8651621341705322},{"business_id":"ndVzILWR-DJXpfOlHm556A","photo_id":"W6MC0w3B6mo3xnpmyIHfeQ","la